        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: The Fatima Mansions, Nude\n- People: Cathal Coughlan, Nick Allum, Jonathan Fell, Zac Woolhouse, Aindrias O'Gruama, Tony Karlsson, Bobby Amaro, Kevin Brown, Cork singer/keyboardist\n- Places: Cork, Hollywood\n- Roles: singer, keyboardist, guitarist, drummer, bassist\n\nFacts:\n- The Fatima Mansions were an art rock group formed in 1988.\n- Cathal Coughlan, a singer and keyboardist from Cork, formed The Fatima Mansions in 1988 after previously being in Microdisney.\n- The original line-up of The Fatima Mansions consisted of Cathal Coughlan, Nick Allum, Jonathan Fell, Zac Woolhouse, and Aindrias O'Gruama.\n- Nude formed in 2004 in Hollywood.\n- The initial members of Nude were Swedish singer and guitarist Tony Karlsson, drummer Bobby Amaro, and bassist Kevin Brown.",
